From e2d985339e724bcbb9d653c74c0d35b99adfbb31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vitor Machado <2932830+vittau@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:52:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Route independent sound writers and live source gains

Support separate music and effects chips and Z80 programs; fader changes ramp gain without rerouting running drivers.
